  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary-island",
      "description": "Live-bound to either skin; default fallbacks show Island.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button ds-primary\">保存记录</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:42px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 17px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#315fd9);outline-offset:4px}.ds-button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-button:active:not(:disabled){filter:brightness(.96)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition:none}}.ds-primary{background:var(--forest,#315fd9);color:var(--accent-ink,#fff)}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--forest-deep,#2449b0)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Subtle action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-subtle",
      "description": "Secondary native action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button ds-subtle\">取消</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:42px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 17px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#315fd9);outline-offset:4px}.ds-button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-button:active:not(:disabled){filter:brightness(.96)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition:none}}.ds-subtle{background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#182d54);border-color:var(--secondary-border,#b8c8e2)}.ds-subtle:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--wash,#edf3ff)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Growth text field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Native text entry; persistence belongs to the app.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\">下一步<textarea class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"写下一个可以尝试的小行动\"></textarea></label>",
      "css": ".ds-label{display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink,#182d54);font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-input{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:9px;min-height:100px;border:1px solid var(--secondary-border,#b8c8e2);border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#182d54);font:15px/1.9 \"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif;resize:vertical;caret-color:var(--green,#315fd9)}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#536b91);opacity:1}.ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--green,#315fd9)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#315fd9);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:640px){.ds-input{font-size:16px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation states",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "Five existing destinations; specimen shows state styling, not route handlers.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a href=\"#today\">今日</a><a href=\"#mail\">邮箱整理</a><a href=\"#growth\" aria-current=\"page\">个人成长</a><a href=\"#history\">任务记录</a><a href=\"#settings\">偏好设置</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding:12px;background:var(--nav,#f8faff);font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-nav a{padding:14px 15px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted,#536b91);font-size:14px;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--green,#315fd9);background:var(--nav-active-bg,#e5edff);font-weight:600}.ds-nav a:hover:not([aria-current]){background:var(--wash,#edf3ff);color:var(--ink,#182d54)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#315fd9);outline-offset:4px}.ds-nav a:active{filter:brightness(.96)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pending status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-awaiting",
      "description": "Noninteractive status with explicit text.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">待确认</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--amber-bg,#fff3e3);color:var(--amber,#8a5426);font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',system-ui,sans-serif;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reading panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "growth-reading-panel",
      "description": "Opaque static reading surface with no invented personal record.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-reading\"><h2>个人成长</h2><p>写下经历，再回看理解如何变化。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-reading{background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#182d54);padding:26px 28px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow,0 14px 44px #314a7320);font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-reading h2{font-size:23px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 16px}.ds-reading p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.95;margin:0;max-width:70ch}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Appearance controls",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "button-subtle",
      "description": "Exactly two native options; app supplies synchronization, migration and stop rules.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-appearance\"><label>皮肤 <select aria-label=\"选择皮肤\"><option value=\"island\">光屿工作台</option><option value=\"observatory\">对页观察室</option></select></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> 粒子动态</label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-appearance{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px 18px;font-size:13px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-appearance label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;color:var(--muted,#536b91)}.ds-appearance select{max-width:100%;min-height:40px;border:1px solid var(--secondary-border,#b8c8e2);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 26px 6px 10px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#182d54);font:inherit}.ds-appearance input{width:16px;height:16px;accent-color:var(--green,#315fd9)}.ds-appearance select:hover{border-color:var(--green,#315fd9)}.ds-appearance select:focus-visible,.ds-appearance input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#315fd9);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Facing periods",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "comparison-cool",
      "description": "Static label specimen; real events and reflections come from authored records.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-compare\"><section><h3>较早记录</h3><p>经历与反省</p></section><section><h3>较近记录</h3><p>经历与反省</p></section></div>",
      "css": ".ds-compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;color:var(--ink,#182d54);font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-compare section{min-width:0;padding:22px;border-radius:14px;background:#f1f7fb}.ds-compare section+section{background:#fcf6ef}.ds-compare h3{font-size:14px;color:var(--green,#315fd9);margin:0 0 12px}.ds-compare p{font-family:AtlasSerif,\"Noto Serif SC\",serif;font-size:19px;line-height:1.85;background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:10px;margin:0}@media(max-width:560px){.ds-compare{grid-template-columns:1fr}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "光屿与对页",
    "overview": "The two image directions approved on 2026-10-17 replace all previous skins. 光屿工作台 (Island) is the default blue and white morning-lake workspace, with vertical desktop navigation and continuous dated records beside the next experiment. 对页观察室 (Observatory) uses a charcoal desktop header, a topic context rail with a lake vignette, and warm/cool facing records. Both keep body text on opaque white surfaces.\n\nThe same factual records, native controls and five destinations serve both spaces. A skin change preserves the live view and unsaved input. Atmosphere supports reading and writing; it does not supply personal history or interpretation.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Two compositions, with Island as the default.",
      "Opaque reading panels and explicit textual states.",
      "Chinese system interface type, with serif Observatory titles and comparison text.",
      "Independent peripheral particles that pause during writing."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Textual State Rule",
        "body": "Every consequential status has a written label; color is an additional cue.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Live Task Rule",
        "body": "Changing appearance preserves live input, focus, scroll and the current view by updating the document skin attribute.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the active skin’s semantic CSS variables across all five routes.",
      "Do lead comparison with event and reflection; keep observation, feedback and action in expandable details.",
      "Do preserve native control semantics, explicit saving, keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do identify fictional mail separately from real growth records.",
      "Do state the actual viewport and capture limits when reporting visual coverage."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add retired skins to the selector or canonical palette.",
      "Don't remount the live route to change appearance.",
      "Don't put reading text on a transparent particle layer.",
      "Don't turn mockup photos, counts, categories or automatic analysis into personal data.",
      "Don't infer hosted deployment, live Gmail access or full mobile/desktop fidelity from this review."
    ]
  }
}
